  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) renforcement de la capacit&#xE9; des acteurs nationaux &#xE0; enqu&#xEA;ter, poursuivre et juger efficacement la corruption, la criminalit&#xE9; &#xE9;conomique et le blanchiment d&apos;argent, y compris par le biais de la coop&#xE9;ration internationale; 2) am&#xE9;lioration de la coordination entre les acteurs impliqu&#xE9;s dans l&apos;enqu&#xEA;te, la poursuite et le jugement des affaires de corruption; 3) am&#xE9;lioration de la coordination entre l&apos;unit&#xE9; d&apos;enqu&#xEA;te de la Police nationale d&#x2019;Ha&#xEF;ti (PNH) et les enqu&#xEA;teurs internationaux.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected results of this project include: (1) strengthened the capacity of national actors to effectively investigate, prosecute and adjudicate corruption, economic crime and money laundering, including through international cooperation; (2) improved coordination between actors involved in the investigation, prosecution and adjudication of corruption cases; and (3) improved coordination between the Haitian National Police (HNP) investigation unit and international investigators.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
